 fective for governing AI agents that make uninterpretable decisions and o
 perate at unprecedented speed and scale.”\n\nSpot one place where someo
 ne\, human or AI\, acts for your business with discretion you can’t see
 .\n\nFeature: Kickoff: how the year runs\, and choosing your case\nKickof
 f: https://protocolsforbusiness.com/kickoffslides08102026/\n\nJoin on the
